title: Moomba, the First 25 Years
summary: A silver-jubilee history of Melbourne's Moomba festival, tracing its parades, monarchs and stunts from its founding in 1955 through to 1979.
---
<p class="lead">Published in 1979 to mark the festival's Silver Jubilee, 'Moomba, the First 25 Years' traces Melbourne's biggest annual community celebration from its 1955 founding.</p>
