    <h2 class="h4">About the book</h2>
    <p>Dunstan recounts a quarter-century of Moomba, from its King and Queen and Birdman Rally through to its river processions and street parades, as one of the events that came to define Melbourne's civic calendar.</p>
    <p>Published by the Sun News-Pictorial and the Moomba Festival, 1979. ISBN 0-9595453-0-1.</p>
